        "original_id": "33d4d26c-8f7b-5965-9a52-b32843e2ed71",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Société de Microélectronique et d'Horlogerie, The Swatch Group, ASUAG, SSIH\n- People: Nicolas Hayek\n- Organizations: Swiss Banks\n- Topics: mergers, Swiss watch industry\n\nFacts:\n- In 1983, Swiss Banks enforced the merger of SSIH and ASUAG into a new holding company named Société de Microélectronique et d'Horlogerie.\n- In 1983, Nicolas Hayek founded The Swatch Group through the merger of Allgemeine Gesellschaft der Schweizerischen Uhrenindustrie (ASUAG) and Société Suisse pour l'Industrie Horlogère (SSIH).\n- Société de Microélectronique et d'Horlogerie was the original name of the company now called The Swatch Group.\n- The Swatch Group is a Swiss manufacturer of watches and jewelry.",
